@host = http://localhost:8000
@email = cliente@taller.local
@password_actual = Cliente123!
@password_nueva = Cliente456!

### 1. Login: obtiene la cookie access_token
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password_actual}}"
}

### 2. Cambio exitoso: 200 sin Set-Cookie de access_token
POST {{host}}/auth/cambiar-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password_actual": "{{password_actual}}",
  "password_nueva": "{{password_nueva}}"
}

### 3. Reutilizar el token viejo en una ruta protegida: 401 por RN-07
GET {{host}}/auth/yo

### 4. Contraseña actual incorrecta: 401 uniforme
POST {{host}}/auth/cambiar-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password_actual": "Incorrecta1",
  "password_nueva": "OtraClave9"
}

### 5. Contraseña nueva fuera de rango: 422 sin repetir contraseñas
POST {{host}}/auth/cambiar-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password_actual": "{{password_nueva}}",
  "password_nueva": "corta"
}

### 6. Campo no declarado: 422
POST {{host}}/auth/cambiar-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password_actual": "{{password_nueva}}",
  "password_nueva": "OtraClave9",
  "campo_extra": "x"
}

### 7. Reautenticación con la contraseña nueva
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password_nueva}}"
}
